# Allowed-signers file for release attestation (ssh-keygen -Y verify).
# Copy to config/release-signers and replace the line below with the release
# maintainer's identity and SSH public key. The identity must match
# ATTESTATION_IDENTITY in scripts/signing.py. Private keys never live here.
release@example.net ssh-ed25519 REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY
